      "duration": 7.6,
      "text": "no value, the market stops paying it. The utility bills pile up and it gets turned off. It literally loses its energy source."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 141.81,
      "end": 149.43,
      "duration": 7.6,
      "text": "So for a digital entity, true autonomy means being capable of governing its own operational state, clearing its own financial"
